rmat%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bf832b4e24f1a99e739a903af5ad5449 3x"}, "body": "Hello, Lio-san! I love your profile page and art style so much! 😊\n\nThe character for this request will be: Taiki Shuttle!\n\nThe outfit I had in mind is her \"Bubblegum☆Memories\" outfit.\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/umamusume/images/2/27/TaikiShuttleAlt.png/revision/latest?cb=20250808035305\nhttps://umamusume.gamedbs.jp/image/costume/3d/1656557105001_zf9r8evm.webp\n\nThe scene and pose I had in mind would be a high-angled selfie of Taiki Shuttle, showing off her outfit and sporting a cheerful, energetic expression. If possible, I had an idea of a caption where she is encouraging her trainer (me) to continue doing well by her and promises to throw another barbecue party with him soon.\n\nThank you for allowing me the opportunity to commission you. 😊", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@LioMaguri5/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eaceda24/uploads/origins/0057f545-4dc6-4bed-8c92-574f057e243b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3cd9272eea4413eb4b55b3b8f7fb8597", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eaceda24/uploads/origins/0057f545-4dc6-4bed-8c92-574f057e243b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3cd9272eea4413eb4b55b3b8f7fb8597, https://si.imgix.net/eaceda24/uploads/origins/0057f545-4dc6-4bed-8c92-574f057e243b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=76d5ba51e21504061eb14a82bdaf094a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eaceda24/uploads/origins/0057f545-4dc6-4bed-8c92-574f05